---
import Docs from '../layouts/Docs.astro';
import source from '../../packages/tokens/source.json';
import pairs from '../../public/assets/botsfired-contrast.json';
function palette(group: any, prefix = ''): string[][] { return Object.entries(group).flatMap(([key,value]: [string,any]) => key.startsWith('$') ? [] : '$value' in value ? [[`${prefix}${key}`,value.$value.hex]] : palette(value,`${prefix}${key}.`)); }
const colors=palette(source.primitive.color);
---
<Docs title="Colour & tokens" active="color" description="Preserved brand values, typed aliases and calculated contrast pairs."><section class="docs-card"><h2>Three tiers, one source</h2><p>Primitives preserve existing values. Semantic tokens describe a role. Components refer to semantic or primitive tokens. The build generates CSS, a DTCG JSON export, resolved values and TypeScript token names.</p><pre><code>{`"component": { "button": { "bg": {
  "$type": "color",
  "$value": "{semantic.color.action.primary.bg}"
}}}`}</code></pre><p>Fire 500 remains the original accent. Its contrast against white is below 4.5:1, so use Fire 600 for normal-size text and white-label buttons. Large text means at least 24px regular or 18.67px bold. UI graphics use their own 3:1 criterion; that does not lower the normal-text requirement.</p><p>Fire 600 stays #D03010, matching existing CSS. The prior #C93E0E documentation value is retired. No new perceptual ramp or print equivalence is asserted.</p></section><section class="docs-card"><h2>Calculated semantic contrast</h2><p>Generated from source colours using WCAG relative luminance. Every listed normal-text pair must reach 4.5:1 before the build passes. These results cover the listed pairs, not every rendered legacy illustration.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Mode</th><th>Role</th><th>Foreground / background</th><th>Ratio</th></tr></thead><tbody>{pairs.map(p=><tr><td>{p.theme}</td><td>{p.label}</td><td><code>{p.foreground} / {p.background}</code></td><td>{p.ratio.toFixed(2)}:1 · passes</td></tr>)}</tbody></table><a href="/assets/botsfired-contrast.json" download>Download calculated matrix</a></section><section class="docs-card"><h2>Colour explorer</h2><p>Copy a value from its swatch. High-contrast reading mode preserves these brand specimens.</p><div class="reference-grid">{colors.map(([name,hex])=><article><div class="token-swatch" style={`background:${hex};--preview-bg:${hex}`} data-brand-preview="true"></div><h3>{name}</h3><p><code>{hex}</code></p><button data-copy={hex} aria-label={`Copy ${name} value`}>Copy hex</button><button data-copy={`var(--bf-primitive-color-${name.replaceAll('.','-')})`} aria-label={`Copy ${name} CSS variable`}>Copy CSS variable</button></article>)}</div><p class="copy-status" role="status"></p></section></Docs>
<style>.token-swatch{height:64px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid currentColor}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}th,td{text-align:left;padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bf-semantic-color-border-default)}</style>
